				<wikidot:authorName>dankaar</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1790336</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That's not a problem, as it can be assumed that the height of the container is irrelevant for this SCP; it just needs to be big enough to hold water in, the depth doesn't really matter beyond the specific needs of the &quot;parent&quot;.</p> <p>A bigger question one should ask is &quot;why specifically a 3x3 container?&quot;</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
