					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398957#post-1276394</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398957/scp-929#post-1276394</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 08 Oct 2011 03:39:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Eskobar</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1173523</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like this quite a bit. However, this has both a major plot hole and a major missed opportunity.</p> <blockquote> <p>it possesses the ability to rapidly change its appearance and biology to match those of any other species.</p> </blockquote> <p>Wouldn't this have manifested as the child of one of the researchers at some point? Meaning you end up with human children with split-open faces and tendrils, getting help from a trained Foundation researcher? This seems terrifying. (I like the idea of children as SCPs a lot.)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
