					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398957#post-1276329</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398957/scp-929#post-1276329</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 08 Oct 2011 01:26:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>PureQuestion</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>985199</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>SCP-929's face and cranium will split and open outwards. A number of tendrils that appear to be similar in composition to imitated organs will emerge from within the created gap.</p> </blockquote> <p>My brain is now shouting &quot;THIS IS SOMEWHAT SIMILAR TO JOHN CARPENTER'S <em>THE THING</em>&quot;</p> <p>As is the imitation aspect, though <em>The Thing</em> didn't try to pretend it was someone's kid. It was more into identity theft. Also infection.</p> <p>Still, it's not excessively similar, so upvoted regardless.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
